{
  "source": "Prompts/does-school-matter-v12.mp4",
  "duration": 141.7173125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.9,
      "text": "A lot of students are quietly asking the same question right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.38,
      "end": 10.14,
      "text": "If an AI can instantly spit out decent drafts, write code, and answer complex questions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.58,
      "end": 13.24,
      "text": "is there any reason to sit through years of classes?"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.0,
      "end": 16.9,
      "text": "Imagine your future dream job."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.32,
      "end": 21.66,
      "text": "You're at your desk, and you use AI all day long to help you plan and code."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.14,
      "end": 24.12,
      "text": "But look at the desk right next to you."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.12,
      "end": 30.1,
      "text": "Your coworker has the exact same job, and they are using the exact same AI tool to do it."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.58,
      "end": 32.08,
      "text": "This is where the challenge begins."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.78,
      "end": 37.14,
      "text": "When everyone asks that system similar questions, it returns similar answers."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.62,
      "end": 40.0,
      "text": "You both receive an identical starting point."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.52,
      "end": 42.84,
      "text": "That baseline output is the new average."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.36,
      "end": 46.9,
      "text": "Because everyone has instant access to that identical starting point,"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.24,
      "end": 49.94,
      "text": "the software itself offers no competitive advantage."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.2,
      "end": 53.0,
      "text": "The difference is what you add."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.0,
      "end": 55.24,
      "text": "AI provides raw material."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.64,
      "end": 60.04,
      "text": "But your unique subject knowledge and practiced problem-solving take the work further."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.74,
      "end": 63.08,
      "text": "In a future where everyone has the same software,"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.6,
      "end": 67.92,
      "text": "what specifically takes you beyond the new average and makes you more valuable than the tool?"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.44,
      "end": 72.82,
      "text": "That extra value comes from the internal knowledge and skills you build through your own effort."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.56,
      "end": 76.96,
      "text": "School provides the structured time and space required to develop those assets."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.38,
      "end": 82.12,
      "text": "You write essays, solve difficult math equations, build physical objects,"
    },
    {
      "start": 82.12,
      "end": 85.58,
      "text": "and navigate the complexities of collaborating with real people."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.36,
      "end": 90.96,
      "text": "Eventually, you find a specific subject that interests you, and you go deep into it."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.34,
      "end": 96.76,
      "text": "Technology will change, but internalized knowledge and practiced skills belong to you permanently."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.72,
      "end": 100.48,
      "text": "Possessing them is what it means to be smarter than the tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.28,
      "end": 102.96,
      "text": "First is deep subject knowledge."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.48,
      "end": 106.22,
      "text": "Find a field you care about and study it intensely."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.82,
      "end": 109.48,
      "text": "Become the person other people turn to for expertise."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.48,
      "end": 112.14,
      "text": "Second, develop strong skills."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.88,
      "end": 116.5,
      "text": "Commit to the hard practice of writing, building, and analyzing data."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.18,
      "end": 120.28,
      "text": "Learn how to turn what you know into work you are proud of."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.82,
      "end": 123.16,
      "text": "Focus on listening, communicating clearly,"
    },
    {
      "start": 123.56,
      "end": 127.24,
      "text": "earning trust, and helping a team turn ideas into action."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.3,
      "end": 131.18,
      "text": "School is where you get to build what you bring to the work."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.0,
      "end": 134.9,
      "text": "The opportunity to learn is already in front of you."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.66,
      "end": 137.0,
      "text": "Choose something you want to get better at."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.0,
      "end": 138.12,
      "text": "Start there."
    }
  ],
